Ushas is a world very far from [[Geography/Færrin/index|Færrin]] and the home of [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]]. Its people count their years from a founding, or a second founding, and make the present year 72. Few from beyond the [[Phenomena/Firmament|firmament]] have any reason to go there.

Ushas is a [[Phenomena/Crystal Sphere|Crystal Sphere]] on the outer rim of the [[Geography/index|Astra]]. It is significant due to its internal composition of nearly 100% antimatter, making it antithetical to most life (excepting the sphere's native inhabitants).


The [[Phenomena/The Pale|Pale]] spread across the world's prime material over the centuries and consumed its old landmasses. [[People/Dorcan|Dorcan]], one of the founders of [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]], remade new landmasses out of it afterward. Most of Ushas's people live on that new ground now, in a place called [[Geography/Ushas/New Volcantum|New Volcantum]]. Old Volcantum is gone.
